<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Applied Voice raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Applied Voice raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said on Wednesday it raised its rating on Applied Voice Technology Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were up 2-3/4 from 16-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
